  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You take on a form halfway between yourself and a beast.</p><p>Choose any animal with a maximum <strong>Stamina</strong> no higher than your own.</p><p>Then choose:</p><ul><li><p>1 stat (such as Body, Athletics, Swim Speed, Size, etc).</p></li><li><p>1 ability (such as a bite attack, water-breathing, etc).</p></li></ul><p>For <strong>1 minute</strong>, your chosen stat becomes the same as that of the animal. You also gain the chosen ability the animal possesses.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 minutes</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.LHk1MjkpB2gk3u7b]{Hybrid Form}</p>",
